          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.11.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 11:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bakataana naitwe, baaturugamu; kwonka bakaba batari baitu; ahakuba kuru baabaire bari abaitu, bakaagumire naitwe; kwonka bakeegyendera, ngu kimanyirwe kimwe ku boona batari baitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka imwe mukashukwaho amajuta Ogwo Orikwera, kandi mwena nimukimanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tinaabahandiikira nk'abatarikumanya mazima, kureka nk'abarikugamanya, kandi nimumanya ngu tihariho kishuba ekiruga omu mazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omubeihi n'oha? T'ogwo ohakana ku Yesu atari Kristo? Antikristo n'ogwo oyehakana Isheboona n'Omwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.5.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 5:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Tihariho oyehakana Omwana akagira Isheboona. Ogwo oikiriza Omwana niwe aine na Isheboona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo eki mwahuriire okwiha iranaira kibe nikyo kyaguma omuriimwe. Eki mwahuriire okwiha iranaira ku kiriguma omuriimwe, naimwe muryaguma omu Mwana n'omuri Isheboona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi endagaano ei yaaturaganiise n'egi, okuheebwa amagara agatahwaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
